@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Activity diagram: machine learning pipeline (data to device)

|AI developer (laptop)|
start
fork
  :Download D-Fire\n(21,527 images, YOLO labels);
  :convert_dfire.py\nYOLO boxes -> smoke / fire / normal\ndrop tiny smoke (< 5 % of image);
fork again
  :esp32cam_collector\nlabelled ESP32-CAM photos\n(incl. fog, steam, vape, sky);
end fork
:preprocess.py\nresize 320x240, dHash de-duplication,\nsplit train / val / test;
note right
  Test set = own camera
  images only (never trained on)
end note
:stats.py\nclass balance per source;
:upload_edge_impulse.py\n(Ingestion API key in .env);
|Edge Impulse (cloud)|
:Impulse: 96x96 RGB, Fit shortest axis;
:Transfer learning\nMobileNetV1 0.25, 50 epochs,\nlr 0.0005, augmentation;
:int8 quantisation;
:Versioning (store version);
fork
  :Export TFLite int8 (.lite);
fork again
  :Export Arduino library\n(EON compiler);
end fork
|AI developer (laptop)|
:predict_tflite.py + confusion_matrix.py\naccuracy, recall, false alarms,\nthreshold sweep;
if (good enough and better\nthan previous version?) then (yes)
  :Install library, USE_MOCK_MODEL 0,\ncompile esp32cam_inference;
  :Update model card;
else (no)
  :Change data or model\n(v1 -> v2 -> v3 ...);
  stop
endif
|ESP32-CAM|
:Flash and measure on device\n(latency, current, field tests);
stop
@enduml
